    "_origins_note": "Blocks contested origins and deep-time claims stated as settled fact. The patterns require an explicit origins or deep-time marker, so ordinary uses of 'ancient' or 'old' in a dated historical fact are unaffected. This deliberately excludes several existing science topics: see the audit in scripts/data/halal-topic-audit.json.",
    "forbid_animate_imagery": true,
